{"id":"5b356f91d7193d28","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-many-one-reducible.md","title":"Many-One Reducible","display":"df-many-one-reducible — Many-One Reducible","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-many-one-reducible","aliases":["92-df-many-one-reducible"],"display":"df-many-one-reducible — Many-One Reducible","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-function]]"],"source":"原书之外的有效程序编号、停机问题、度与多一归约背景；本库明示可接受编号与参数条件","source_status":"外部递归论背景"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-many-one-reducible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-many-one-reducible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-many-one-reducible — Many-One Reducible"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的有效程序编号、停机问题、度与多一归约背景；本库明示可接受编号与参数条件"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部递归论背景"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-many-one-reducible-—-Many-One-Reducible-$\\leq_m$\">df-many-one-reducible — Many-One Reducible <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A, B \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A, B \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}\\)</span> (total-recursive function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span> (definition-target many-one reducibility)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reducible} \\vdash A\\leq_m B\\leftrightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reducible} \\vdash A\\leq_m B\\leftrightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\leq_m B\">\\(A \\leq_m B\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>多一可归约到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span></li>\n<li>存在递归函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>将<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>映射到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n \\in A\">\\(n \\in A\\)</span> iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n) \\in B\">\\(f(n) \\in B\\)</span></li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>可判定，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>可判定</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>不可判定且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\leq_m B\">\\(A \\leq_m B\\)</span>，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>不可判定</li>\n<li>用于证明不可判定性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-many-one-reducible-—-Many-One-Reducible-$\\leq_m$","text":"df-many-one-reducible — Many-One Reducible $\\leq_m$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}$ (total-recursive function predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\leq_m","display":false},{"tex":"A, B \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}many\\text{-}one\\text{-}reducible} \\vdash A\\leq_m B\\leftrightarrow\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(n\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(n)\\in B)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"A \\leq_m B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"n \\in A","display":false},{"tex":"f(n) \\in B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A \\leq_m B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":1160,"backlinks":[{"id":"9f063fb5c2ee3d66","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leq_m$ (many-one reducibility, see [[92-df-many-one-reducible]])"},{"id":"828452ef97907ed6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"81eaa2bfca5c6209","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A \\leq_m B$ (see [[92-df-many-one-reducible]])"},{"id":"b9b07b1eae12ec61","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K\\equiv_m K_G$ abbreviates $K\\leq_m K_G$ an